      <title>Normalizing Delcy Rodríguez Won’t Fix Venezuela</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/opinion/articles/2026-09-23/normalizing-delcy-rodriguez-won-t-fix-venezuela</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">326fe439431a2a35332deed3</guid>
      <pubDate>Wed, 23 Sep 2026 11:30:15 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>Delcy alights from a glamorous Gulfstream G500 onto the tarmac of Teterboro, a short drive from Manhattan. She is all smiles, exuding confidence. Later, she meets US President Donald Trump. More smiles, more handshakes. She also gathers with the UN chief, the IMF chief and the World Bank chief. She utters some empty words about being in New York to help humanity achieve peace and stability. Cue more smiles.</description>
